色も模様も{NICKNAME}っぽいな！","nextNodeIds":[705470115]},{"nodeId":705470115,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30531,"speakerName":"ヴァレリナ","textMapHash":801660946,"text":"このゲームは、火花ドドコ、閃光ドドコ、騎兵ドドコ、魔法ドドコが力を合わせ、これまでに立ち向かったことのないような敵に、爆弾で挑むというものです。","nextNodeIds":[705470116]},{"nodeId":705470116,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30531,"speakerName":"ヴァレリナ","textMapHash":948140426,"text":"私はゲームのスポンサーと運営のみを担当しているので、開発の詳細については把握していません。敵のモデルが現実世界ではどのような姿をしているかも知りません…","nextNodeIds":[705470117]},{"nodeId":705470117,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30531,"speakerName":"ヴァレリナ","textMapHash":1426977810,"text":"でも、いつか本当に現実で鉢合わせたとしても、不思議なドドコならきっと勝てるはずです！","nextNodeIds":[705470118]},{"nodeId":705470118,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"パイモン","textMapHash":3392708098,"text":"もちろんだぞ！オイラも、どんな魔物でもクレーとドドコを止められないと思うぜ。","nextNodeIds":[705470119,705470120]},{"nodeId":705470119,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":2203898658,"text":"じゃあ、戦ってみよう！","nextNodeIds":[705470121]},{"nodeId":705470121,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30531,"speakerName":"ヴァレリナ","textMapHash":3382669114,"text":"へへっ、お二人もきっと楽しめますよ！","nextNodeIds":[]},{"nodeId":705470120,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":1183949882,"text":"#ドドコの新しい{M#ゲームだ}{F#ゲーム}！","nextNodeIds":[705470121]},{"nodeId":705470111,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":2252115098,"text":"誰をモデルにしてるか分かりやすい。","nextNodeIds":[705470112]},{"nodeId":705470104,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":2225843898,"text":"聞いたことのないあだ名…","nextNodeIds":[705470105]}]}],"conditions":{"finishCond":[{"BFGALAINLMD":0,"LNHLPKELCAL":[7054701,0],"PAINLIBBLDK":"QUEST_CONTENT_COMPLETE_TALK","PPFLKMOMKAI":""}],"triggerCond":[],"execActions":[],"guide":{"BEALNDJFMMC":"QUEST_GUIDE_IN_SCENE_STYLE_NONE","BJKFMDGPIBN":"QUEST_GUIDE_INDICATOR_STYLE_NONE","CCLPMCLNLBJ":"NONE","CJHEDKCI